#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_coupling_analysis.ipynb:10002
#: 661384cbe90e4548bbff3298f526f115
msgid "Coupling Analysis: Estimating Transfer Paths Between Channels"
msgstr "カップリング解析: チャンネル間伝達経路の推定"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_coupling_analysis.ipynb:20002
#: 568d961b1f584ed4b36bcc9a4c6ae25f
msgid ""
"This case study promotes the legacy PEM injection tutorial into the public "
"docs. The output is a **coupling function**: a frequency-dependent estimate "
"of how witness-channel noise projects into the target channel."
msgstr ""
"このケーススタディは legacy の PEM injection notebook を公開 docs 用に整理したものです。出力は **結合関数** "
"で、witness チャンネルの雑音が target にどう投影されるかを周波数ごとに推定します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_coupling_analysis.ipynb:20004
#: 0819a449b289435a9154dc35a2111679
msgid ""
"That estimate is powerful for diagnosis, but it still models a transfer path"
" rather than proving the physical mechanism behind it."
msgstr "ただし、この推定は伝達経路のモデルであって、物理機構そのものを証明するものではありません。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_coupling_analysis.ipynb:40002
#: d8e74a038a6c42bd8261045f2e281ed0
msgid "1. Estimate the coupling function"
msgstr "1. 結合関数を推定する"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_coupling_analysis.ipynb:40004
#: 554ec629ad5f486cb8538b11bc2e5385
msgid ""
"The coupling function compares target excess to witness excess. If the "
"witness injection does not produce significant target excess, the result "
"becomes an upper limit rather than a direct estimate."
msgstr ""
"結合関数は target の excess と witness の excess を比で見ています。target 側に有意な excess "
"が出なければ、推定値ではなく upper limit を返す帯域もあります。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_coupling_analysis.ipynb:60002
#: 23c17d77914a4784889d5d1abd3f9d41
msgid "2. Compare threshold strategies"
msgstr "2. しきい値戦略を変えて比べる"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_coupling_analysis.ipynb:60004
#: f7ed6c2f3a0e4437a14727270d760edb
msgid ""
"Changing the threshold strategy changes how conservative the coupling "
"estimate is. This matters when injection lines are intermittent or when the "
"target channel barely rises above background."
msgstr "しきい値の選び方を変えると、どこまで保守的に coupling を見積もるかが変わります。注入線が弱い帯域ほど、その違いが効きます。"
